## tRPC Setup

This project uses **nestjs-trpc** with decorator-based routing.

### Generating tRPC Types

After creating or modifying routers, generate the tRPC types:

```bash
{{#if isPnpm}}pnpm trpc:generate{{else if isYarn}}yarn trpc:generate{{else if isBun}}bun run trpc:generate{{else}}npm run trpc:generate{{/if}}
```

For watch mode (auto-regenerates on changes):

